      <title>MiniTool pwdrvio.sys Kernel Driver Buffer Overflow — Local DoS/BSOD (CVE-2026-36980)</title>
      <link>http://192.168.0.124:1313/pocs/binary/2026-07-05_cve-2026-36980-minitool-kernel-driver-bsod-dos/</link>
      <pubDate>Sun, 05 Jul 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
